EASE MENT AND ASSIGNMENT OF LEASE AGREEMENT
This EASEMENT AND ASSIGNMENT OF LEASE AGREEMENT("Agreement")is
made as of this
day of
,2021("Effective Date"), by and between
the City of Cheyenne, a municipal corporation existing under the laws of the State of Wyoming
("Grantor"), and Eco-Site, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company ("Grantee").
WHEREAS, Grantor is currently the fee owner of that certain improved real property
more particularly described on Exhibit A, attached hereto and incorporated herein ("Burdened
Property"); and
WHEREAS, Grantee currently owns and operates a communications towers and related
systems and equipment (collectively, the “Tower") located in and on a portion of the Burdened
Property; and
WHEREAS, Grantor desires to grant to Grantee certain easement rights with respect to
the Burdened Property, which shall, among other things, allow Grantee to access and operate the
Tower; and
WHEREAS, Grantor is the current landlord under that certain Lease Agreement dated
April 6,2017, by and between Grantor and Grantee, as evidenced by the Form of Memorandum
of Lease dated April 6,2017, and recorded on November 1,2017, in Book #2567, Page #1541,
in the official records of the Clerk of Laramie County, Wyoming("Lease'); and
WHEREAS, Grantor desires to assign to Grantee, and Grantee desires to assume from
Grantor, all of Grantor's right, title, and interest as landlord in the Lease.
NOW, THEREFORE, for and in consideration of the mutual covenants and agreements
contained herein, and other good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which
are hereby acknowledged, the parties here to agree asfollows:
